WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.872
The Jade Emperor was sitting on his throne in the Cloud Palace.

2
00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:10.223
[g@A messenger ran into the court.

3
00:00:10.224 --> 00:00:12.702
"Your Majesty," he said.@g]

4
00:00:12.703 --> 00:00:16.906
"The Dragon King of the Eastern Sea is here to see you."

5
00:00:16.907 --> 00:00:20.429
"Let him in," said the emperor.

6
00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:23.264
The Dragon King entered and bowed.

7
00:00:23.265 --> 00:00:26.829
"Your Majesty, I want to make a complaint.

8
00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:31.332
Sun Wukong came to my palace and demanded I give him a weapon.

9
00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:33.697
He was very rude."

10
00:00:33.698 --> 00:00:37.364
Another messenger came in.

11
00:00:37.365 --> 00:00:43.854
"The Judge of the Dead would like to speak with you, Your Majesty."

12
00:00:43.855 --> 00:00:46.810
The judge came in and bowed.

13
00:00:46.811 --> 00:00:52.648
"A monkey named Sun Wukong crossed out his name in the Directory.

14
00:00:52.649 --> 00:00:55.209
I beg you to punish him!"

15
00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:58.421
The Jade Emperor rubbed his chin.

16
00:00:58.422 --> 00:01:00.578
[g@"Who is this Sun Wukong?

17
00:01:00.579 --> 00:01:03.642
And how did he become so powerful?"@g]

18
00:01:03.643 --> 00:01:06.624
The emperor's captain stepped forward.

19
00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:12.015
"Sun Wukong is the monkey who was born from a rock three hundred years ago.

20
00:01:12.016 --> 00:01:15.311
I don't know how he became so powerful."

21
00:01:15.312 --> 00:01:18.772
[g@"I remember him," said the Jade Emperor.

22
00:01:18.773 --> 00:01:21.730
"I don't care how powerful he is.@g]

23
00:01:21.731 --> 00:01:25.404
He is causing too much trouble on Earth.

24
00:01:25.405 --> 00:01:29.723
Gather some troops, and go down to the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

25
00:01:29.724 --> 00:01:33.305
I want Sun Wukong arrested!"

26
00:01:33.306 --> 00:01:37.758
The spirit of the planet Venus stepped forward.

27
00:01:37.759 --> 00:01:40.482
"Your Majesty," said Venus.

28
00:01:40.483 --> 00:01:44.853
"Perhaps we could give Wukong a job here in Heaven."

29
00:01:44.854 --> 00:01:47.768
[g@The Jade Emperor raised his eyebrows.

30
00:01:47.769 --> 00:01:49.933
"Why would we do that?"@g]

31
00:01:49.934 --> 00:01:54.271
"If he's here, we can keep an eye on him," said Venus.

32
00:01:54.272 --> 00:01:58.032
"It will be easy to keep him out of trouble."

33
00:01:58.033 --> 00:02:00.641
[g@"Very well," said the emperor.

34
00:02:00.642 --> 00:02:04.313
"Invite Wukong to come to live in Heaven.@g]

35
00:02:04.314 --> 00:02:11.563
He will be in charge of the Royal Peach Garden."

36
00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:16.830
Wukong was telling his subjects about his adventure in the Land of Darkness.

37
00:02:16.831 --> 00:02:22.065
"After I crossed out my name," he said, "I crossed out all of your names too.

38
00:02:22.066 --> 00:02:25.014
We will all live forever!"

39
00:02:25.015 --> 00:02:27.033
[g@The monkeys and apes cheered.

40
00:02:27.034 --> 00:02:30.430
"Hooray for the Monkey King!"@g]

41
00:02:30.431 --> 00:02:34.432
Wukong noticed a spirit standing nearby.

42
00:02:34.433 --> 00:02:38.691
He pulled out his iron bar. "Who are you?"

43
00:02:38.692 --> 00:02:41.519
[g@"I am Venus," said the spirit.

44
00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:44.808
"I have an invitation from the Jade Emperor.@g]

45
00:02:44.809 --> 00:02:48.029
He would like you to come to live in Heaven."

46
00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:56.835
Wukong smiled. "At last he has invited me."

47
00:02:56.836 --> 00:03:03.419
When Wukong entered the royal court in the Cloud Palace, he didn't bow.

48
00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:08.201
"You're supposed to bow before the emperor," whispered Venus.

49
00:03:08.202 --> 00:03:12.541
Wukong laughed. "I'm just as powerful as he is.

50
00:03:12.542 --> 00:03:16.425
Maybe he should bow before me!"

51
00:03:16.426 --> 00:03:20.086
Everyone but the Jade Emperor gasped.

52
00:03:20.087 --> 00:03:22.302
[g@Wukong looked at the emperor.

53
00:03:22.303 --> 00:03:24.550
"I'm glad you invited me.@g]

54
00:03:24.551 --> 00:03:29.384
I guess you finally realized I should be living up here with all of you."

55
00:03:29.385 --> 00:03:32.515
"Show some respect," said Venus.

56
00:03:32.516 --> 00:03:36.410
The Jade Emperor looked at Venus and smiled.

57
00:03:36.411 --> 00:03:38.445
[g@"Wukong is new here.

58
00:03:38.446 --> 00:03:41.905
He can be excused for not acting the right way."@g]

59
00:03:41.906 --> 00:03:43.989
He looked at Wukong.

60
00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.491
"I'm putting you in charge of the Royal Peach Garden.

61
00:03:47.492 --> 00:03:50.401
You will have a home here in Heaven.

62
00:03:50.402 --> 00:03:55.037
I hope you won't cause any more trouble."

63
00:03:55.038 --> 00:03:58.982
"That sounds perfect!" said Wukong.

64
00:03:58.983 --> 00:04:03.632
The next morning a gardener showed Wukong the peach garden.

65
00:04:03.633 --> 00:04:09.253
Bright, glowing peaches hung from every branch.

66
00:04:09.254 --> 00:04:14.124
"The peaches in this garden are not like peaches on Earth," said the gardener.

67
00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:17.749
"These peaches take thousands of years to become ripe.

68
00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:24.516
Anybody who takes a bite of one will live forever."

69
00:04:24.517 --> 00:04:29.689
Each morning Wukong inspected the trees in the garden.

70
00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:34.935
He took his job very seriously.

71
00:04:34.936 --> 00:04:38.704
[g@"These peaches look delicious," Wukong thought one day.

72
00:04:38.705 --> 00:04:40.878
He looked around.@g]

73
00:04:40.879 --> 00:04:45.165
[g@None of the gardeners were in sight.

74
00:04:45.166 --> 00:04:50.933
"Maybe I'll eat one."@g]

